 "lines": {"bass_scoop_the_leaves_from_the_leaping_lane": ["Lane's clear. Now it can hit the water properly.", "Leaves out. It doesn't thank anyone. Standard fish."], "bass_shove_the_stranded_bass_back_in": ["Back in. It will do that again by lunchtime.", "Saved a fish from the stones. It had no plan."], "bass_hold_a_flake_high_for_the_leap": ["Took it clean out of my bill. The splash was extra.", "It leapt. I flinched. Both of us pretend it did not happen."], "bass_hold_a_reed_hoop_over_the_water": ["Through the hoop. Nobody applauded. I applauded.", "Circus fish. I am the ringmaster. Good arrangement."], "bass_race_the_bass_along_the_edge": ["Lost by two lengths. Mine were shorter.", "Fish does not run. Fish still wins. Rigged."], "bass_measure_the_leap_on_a_stem": ["Four reeds high. Showy. I measured it twice, it did not blink.", "Height of a leap, taken with a plant. Science."], "bass_compare_the_spiny_back_with_the_record": ["Spikier than me. Bigger chip on its shoulder too.", "Held a wing to a fin. Mine is the softer argument."], "bass_sit_for_the_first_rise_at_dusk": ["Sat. Waited. Nothing rose. Then everything did.", "Dusk rises are punctual. Mine is the timing of a sulk."], "bass_bow_to_the_champion_leaper": ["Bowed to a fish. It leapt in thanks. Or panic.", "Respect, cleared with a reed to spare."], "bass_argue_the_leap_height": ["It claims five reeds. I saw four. Sworn statement.", "Fish and I disagree on air. Air takes no side."], "bass_shout_the_score_at_the_cattails": ["Ten. Out of ten. Fish wrote the score card.", "Told the reeds. Reeds did not clap, reeds never do."], "bass_hop_back_from_the_soaking_splash": ["Soaked. It did that on purpose and I respect it.", "A fish just got the last word and it was wet."], "bass_swap_leap_counts_with_a_friend": ["We counted twelve. Fish says four. It was there.", "Two ducks, one pond, no agreement. Fish abstains."]},
